  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_1328acea-59f1-4a0e-a216-6743e66be8c9.png\" alt=\"Watt About Power? by Tr3yMix\" width=\"850\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_2ae9178d-cd85-4b68-aa36-5317c1d4e361.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_c20746bf-4e97-4635-b4c8-56e32ae2fd9a.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_4d0ba42a-9008-41e4-a22a-72d6b0d16970.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>依赖项</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_9c999190-1b30-4ab8-bb3f-37979f849154.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_d8dba763-5746-4b59-ac79-f614dc3b1082.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_6241c1c3-131c-474a-ae1f-34b2b1c176b9.png\" alt=\"Architectury API\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>✨ <strong>关于模组</strong>&nbsp;✨</p>\n<p>你是否曾想过只需轻轻一按开关，就能让你的《我的世界》家园焕发生机——而无需喂养你那耗电巨大的发电机？借助这款为 MrCrayfish 的全新家具模组“Furniture Refurbished”打造的插件，现在你可以做到了！⚡</p>\n<p>本模组添加了一个名为“断路器”的新方块。这个精巧的小方块成为了你家电力系统的“新心脏”，直接从你喜爱的科技模组（如 Mekanism、Tech Reborn 和 Create: Crafts and Additions）中汲取电力。再也不用为了制作火把或点燃篝火而将煤炭喂给发电机了——只需简单、可持续的能源，即可让你的灯具持续发光、吊扇不停旋转。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_46ddc807-aaad-4342-bb90-ab6143075cb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_3047e4e7-129f-4f3f-874c-bc834dcc5fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">*已在 Mekanism、Tech Reborn、Integrated Dynamics 和 Create Crafts &amp; Additions 上测试通过。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_700d7ff5-1383-4695-bb82-582298b9a06d.png\" alt=\"Mekanism\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a0daf121-03bc-4cc9-afac-9da1f774db83.png\" alt=\"Tech Reborn\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a5079aaf-127e-4c58-9420-905fdbc3a336.png\" alt=\"Create Crafts &amp; Additions\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_bc03d42d-7d35-485f-af4c-0794803952ee.png\" alt=\"integrated dynamics\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>原版模组及其内容的全部功劳归于 MrCrayfish。感谢您出色的工作！</p>",
